Scope of this licence

* The MIT licence above applies to the source code in src/, tests/ and config/
  (including the build scripts under src/publish/ and src/viz/).
* The documents (README.md, docs/, schemas/, AGENT_CONTEXT.md,
  CAREER_DECISION_MAP.md, CAREER_SUPPLY_DEMAND_MAP.md, DECISION_LOG.md,
  PUBLICATION_DECISION.md) and the aggregated statistical outputs
  (outputs/tables, outputs/*.json, outputs/figures, outputs/reports/digest.txt)
  are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  licence (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . Please
  cite as described in CITATION.cff.
* Layer 1 aggregates are statistics derived from job advertisements published
  by third parties (AMS/EURES, karriere.at, LinkedIn job listings, willhaben,
  jobs.at, and for the dated T19 supplement python-jobspy LinkedIn job listings
  and the Arbeitnow API) and from the AMS JobBarometer. No advertisement text,
  no source posting identifiers or URLs, no employer contact data and no source
  records are part of this public repository; the tables carry only opaque
  internal hashes (posting_uid) that cannot be resolved without the private
  data. The underlying source material remains private and is not licensed here
  (see PUBLICATION_DECISION.md and docs/legal-and-publication-audit.md).
  Employer names in the employer tables are the names of legal entities as they
  appear in public advertisements.
* Layer 2 aggregates derived from public GitHub profiles and repositories
  (collected through the GitHub REST API) contain counts, shares and intervals
  only; phrases and README headings appear only when shared by at least 3
  accounts / 5 projects. No login, name, bio, README text or other
  individual-level record is published, and nothing here licenses GitHub
  content, which remains under its authors' own terms.
* Tables and figures derived from the Stack Overflow Developer Survey 2025 are
  Produced Works based on a database licensed under the Open Database License
  (ODbL) 1.0, https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/ ; the survey data
  is (c) Stack Overflow. The Austrian extract of the survey (a Derivative
  Database) is not distributed here.
* data/raw/eurostat_jvs/ and data/raw/eurostat_supply/ and the tables derived
  from them contain Eurostat data, (c) European Union, reused under the
  Commission's reuse policy (Decision 2011/833/EU; Eurostat copyright notice,
  attribution required). The CC BY 4.0 licence above does not replace those
  terms for the raw files.
* The Lato fonts vendored in src/viz/styles/fonts/ (Lato-Regular.ttf,
  Lato-Bold.ttf) are (c) 2010-2014 tyPoland Lukasz Dziedzic and are licensed
  under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1; the full licence text is in
  src/viz/styles/fonts/OFL.txt. They are not covered by the MIT licence.
* No licence is granted for any third-party content, trade mark or database
  right; the licences above do not extend to material owned by the sources.
